  "description": "QUCNEJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H58 Dy4 N6 O26,5(C1 H4 O1),7(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.505-3.836 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.98-109.95°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C65H92Dy4N6O38.",
